(THG-09: a data field is `a <type> called <name>` with an optional
 `is <literal>` default; a field without one takes its type's zero value.
 Also covers: THG-12 (zero values), THG-15 (number, float, boolean and time
 are all legal field types).
 Note the `time` field: it takes 0 with no initialiser, though a `time`
 VARIABLE must be initialised (LANGUAGE.md:531, 543-546) - see Discrepancy 1.
